window.products.push({"id":576039,"name":"Niwo ART (TM - Kirche in Cassone, by Gustav Klimt, Oil Painting Reproduction - Giclee Wall Art for Home Decor, Gallery Wrapped, Stretched, Framed Read","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TXbB6sKKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kirche in Cassone Year Created: 1913, by Gustav Klimt Background: This painting is one of the finest examples of Gustav Klimt paintings. The landscape combines the rich trees with the houses that cascade down to the lake. The painting is the union of the architecture and nature, that comprises the harmonious composition, creating the dynamic surface, shimmering in the daylight. This painting was sold at Sotheby’s London in 2010 for $42,966,320 Here are reasons You're Going to LOVE Your Niwo Art (TM) Canvas Prints: - Made in USA, Fast & free shipping. A perfect choice for wall decor at home and in office. Also makes a perfect gift. - 100% HANDMADE Each canvas print hand-stretched. Multiple sizes available.- State of the art 12-ink Giclee print technology from Canon ensures the best quality, realizes an expanded range which enables greater overall balance and provides more vivid colors.- Pigment-based inks rather than other inks found in lower cost inkjets. Pigment-based inks have a longer life span that can last over 100 years without significant fading.- Acid free archival quality canvas made of 100% cotton.- Coated with water-based varnish to protect and preserve fine art and photographic prints. It will enhance the color, increase resistance to image fading, and protect prints against moisture and abrasion. - Gallery Wrap. We are adding an extra 0.75-1.5 inch necessary for the borders using some pixels from the edges of your image and creating a border.- Real wood frame (Non-MDF) & Solvent-free Ink: odorless and can be used by someone with allergies and in kids' rooms.- Ready to hang. Hook is mounted inside of the frame so no gap visible between wall and the frame. Frame is wrapped very carefully in bubble or foam wrap to ensure safe shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TXbB6sKKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Niwo ART","source_asin":"B06XVJXZGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576039","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XVJXZGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XVJXZGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
