window.products.push({"id":576097,"name":"Aru-Boat by Preston, 12x36-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.64,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518l1h1i0fL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features two boats. Preston discovered a passion for photography at the age of 18 and is an international award winning photographer. He categorizes himself as a point-and-shoot photographer; capturing the world in its original state. Preston enjoys the challenge of photographing natural elements, things that he cannot direct or change. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518l1h1i0fL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00D16PH4Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D16PH4Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D16PH4Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
