window.products.push({"id":576270,"name":"Chicken Egg Collecting Apron,12 Deep Pockets Hen Duck Goose Eggs Holder Aprons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CGuwPh52L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great For Chicken Lovers: If you, your family or your friends are the chicken lovers, this egg apron may fit you best. Do you still collect your chicken eggs in the pocket of your sweater or create a basket with your shirt? If you are guilty of either of these egg collecting methods then this apron is for you. No more broken eggs in your sweater or your shirt. No more trying to juggle a dozen eggs in your hands, the heavy duty waist apron fits just about everyone with its extra long ties. Product Detail: Material: 100% Premium Quality Polyester Size: 20.5inches L*18.5 inches W Belt: 37.8inches/side. Color: Dandelion, Rooster, Hen, Dot This Short Egg Collection Apron's Features: 1. A great helper when you want a hand-free after collecting. 2. A great gift when you do have chicken-caring families. 3. Fit Women and Men, youth and old, with long belt can be adjusted. Package Include: 1* Egg Apron","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CGuwPh52L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEIFINI","source_asin":"B07ZYS57X4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZYS57X4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZYS57X4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":576271,"name":"Hanging woven wall basket set of 3 - Home decor, boho wall art bowls, to be used as fruit, vegetable, or storage baskets, and living room, kitchen, be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91JSI6AkuiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MADE from ALL NATURAL seagrass / water hyacinth fibers. These fibers come from a free-floating perennial aquatic plant with broad, thick, glossy, ovate leaves, that rise above the surface of the water as much as 3ft in heightHOW IT’S MADE - To get to the final product, farmers first harvest the freshwater hyacinth, process the fibers, then dry them. After drying, the seagrass fibers have a natural golden color. For different coloration on the fibers, they dye the water hyacinth fibers and repeat the drying process. In the second stage, the craftsmen start knitting these fibers into designs. When knitting is completed, to ensure the humidity is not too high and protect the product from mold, the drying process is repeated. After that your product is ready to be packaged and sent to you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91JSI6AkuiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NM First Page LLC","source_asin":"B08XMTGS2S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XMTGS2S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XMTGS2S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
