window.products.push({"id":576321,"name":"Kuhn Rikon Durotherm 5-1/3-Quart Pressure Cooker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31K1XNXQSQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Kuhn Rikon brings you the ultimate premium cookware designed for versatile performance both on the stove and one your table. Swiss precision and tabletop elegance united in double-walled-walled stainless steel. Amazon.com The Durotherm pressure cooker combines the best of pressurized and conventional cooking in an elegant vessel. Kuhn Rikon makes the cooker in Switzerland of mirror-polished, double-walled 18/10 stainless-steel construction, with a heat-efficient aluminum core in the base. Two stay-cool side handles and a clip-on insulated base allow you to carry and place this beauty directly on the table for elegant serving. Two lids are included: a two-handled pressure lid with its new-generation spring-loaded valve for safety; and a thermal-insulated lid with stay-cool handle for highly efficient, self-basting conventional cooking. Thanks to the insulated lid and base, the food inside the cooker can stay hot for two hours after it's done, a boon to a family on a staggered eating schedule. Also included is a steam trivet that sets inside the bottom of the pot for virtually water-free and therefore highly nutritious cooking. Swiss company Kuhn Rikon has been making and improving upon pressure cookers since 1949. The Durotherm and Duromatic cookers are quieter, safer, and a smart option in today's world, given how quickly one cooks and how much energy it saves. Pressure cookers are rapidly gaining in popularity, and the Durotherm is an exceptional model. You'll find such foods as rice, grains, stews, poultry, and vegetables cook in just one-third the time of conventional methods, and retain vital nutrients. By saving 70 percent of the gas or electricity normally used in conventional cooking, the pressure cooker can pay for itself in just months. Kuhn Rikon covers the dishwasher-safe cooker with a 10-year warranty on materials and workmanship, and guarantees parts will be available for 15 years. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box Durotherm pressure cooker and accessories. The set includes: pressure cooker; pressure lid; thermal-insulated lid; internal steaming trivet; clip-on insulated serving base. 5 items total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31K1XNXQSQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUHN RIKON","source_asin":"B00009A9XQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00009A9XQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00009A9XQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
