window.products.push({"id":576420,"name":"Abucaky Rustic Sunflowers Wall Clock Battery Operated Silent Non Ticking Round Clock Floral Background Art Wall Decor for Farmhouse School Home 9.8 In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BUduC1cZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorate your house with the stylish designing wall clock, enjoy a colourful moment anytime. Also as a gift for your parents, children, relatives and friends, they will love this fuctional & decorative clock. Product Specifications: ★Material: Imported MDF, no frame nor glass cover★Diameter: 9.8 inches/ 25 cm★Power Source: 1 x AA battery(not included)★Movement Type: Sweep seconds movement★Package Contains: 1 x Wall Clock, 1 x Sturdy Frame★Occasion: Living Room, Bedroom, Kitchen, Clinic, Office, School and Library etc. Warm Tips: ★Due to the batteries is limited by international transport, the battery is not contained in the package, you may purchase the battery from the local.★After you put the battery into the clock, make sure the screw on the minute hand wont be too tight. Because the wheel gear of Quartz won't be moving normally if it's too tight.(You can check the back of the clock)★Due to long-distance transportation, the pointer may be loose. It is recommended to reinstall after getting it. When calibrating the time, please move all the hands to the 12 o'clock position, then put the battery to start the pointer.★There are slight difference between the product picture and the real clock caused by light brightness. Customer Are Our Priority: Abucaky is committed to meet the customized needs of various clients for their Home and Home Decoration. We adopt the highest digital printing technology and highest grade ink to ensure vibrant colors and lasting durability. We stand behind our products and focus on customers' shopping experience. We offer 100% no risk money-back guarantee if the clock has any problem or you are not satisfied with your order for any reason. Just tell us and we will do our best to give you the most satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BUduC1cZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Abucaky","source_asin":"B0896SPHJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0896SPHJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0896SPHJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
