window.products.push({"id":576559,"name":"Lenox Holiday Tartan Gold-Banded Carved Teapot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XXMH8SZHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A festive plaid bow secures an arrangement of fruit and holly in the design that graces this Lenox china teapot. The teapot is encircled by a raised lattice motif that gives way to the colorful design. A Tartan band decorates the lid, and both the lid and teapot are accented with 24 karat gold. Amazon.com A red plaid ribbon festively curls along the border of Holiday Tartan dinnerware, tying bows around bunches of holly, fruit, and acorns. Red, green, and gold tones predominate on a creamy white glaze. Crafted of ivory fine china, this \"carved\" teapot gets its name from the textured lattice background on both the pot and lid, which are generously trimmed in 24-karat gold. The graceful traditional shape showcases the fruit motif on two sides while a tartan band encircles the lid. Like the full range of matching Holiday Tartan dinnerware, the teapot is dishwasher-safe, making cleanup easy during the busy holiday season. Lenox backs its products with a lifetime warranty, and will replace any unsatisfactory item or provide the customer a full refund. In addition, under its lifetime breakage replacement program, Lenox will replace any broken piece that is in stock at 50 percent off the current suggested retail price. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XXMH8SZHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lenox","source_asin":"B0009PD8DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009PD8DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009PD8DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":576560,"name":"Winlyn Set of 3 Assorted Small Potted Succulents Arrangement Artificial Succulent Plants in Black and White Geometric Pots for Table Centerpiece Windo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+MVlyIC1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quantity: Set of 3 assorted small fake potted succulent plants comes packaged nicely in a box. Three different types of artificial succulents including Aloe, Echeveria, and Hops succulents are pre-potted in 3 pcs black and gray concrete ceramic pots. These concrete pots with textured mud cloth inspired geometric patterns create a modern and bohemian look to accent your home and office decoration. Perfect to bring some greenery into your room and create a warm atmosphere. Color: This set of 3 faux potted succulent plants feature a variety of succulents in beautiful shades of green nestling in natural pebbles and sit in 3 pcs cylinder concrete pots. With a nomadic and primal design, these planters boast intricate embossed tribal patterns with geometric elements inspired by mud cloth, all rendered in black to contrast the succulents. They fit in well with decoration from modern to rustic and perfect to add a simplistic aesthetic to your settings. Size: These small artificial potted succulent plants measure about 4.5\"-7.3\" wide and 5.5\"-9.1\" tall. Each cute concrete ceramic pot measures about 3.3\" wide and 3.5\" tall. These small plants can be displayed together or individually placed around your house. The perfect small size makes these cute fake potted succulents the ideal accessories on small spaces like office desk, shelves, or windowsill. Material: Lifelike in color and texture, these fake succulent plants are made of latex and plastic with realistic detailing. The planters are constructed of concrete and the pattern is carved upon the surface and painted in black, each planter is unique and handmade. The sturdy composition of the concrete material will allow you to place the potted plants both indoors and outdoors without worrying them easily topple over. No watering or sunlight is required for these faux plants to stay fresh. Small faux potted succulent plants bring the natural look to your desk, dining table, coffee table, entryway table, windowsill, floating shelf, bathroom counter, kitchen island, bookshelf, mantel, end table, nightstand, dresser, toilet tank, bedroom, living room, apartment, dorm, or places that don't get enough light. They also make great housewarming gift, birthday gift, holiday gift, hostess gift, Mother's Day gift, wedding favor, bridal shower favor, or keepsakes for special events.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+MVlyIC1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B09TDHW89B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TDHW89B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TDHW89B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
