window.products.push({"id":576672,"name":"Carolina Creekhouse Sarah FloorFlat (039629UA) | Decorative Vinyl Floor Covering | Lay Flat | Durable | No Curling Edges | Waterproof | Easy Clean | W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OEQzUe61L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CREATIVE ARRANGEMENT Enhance your space with the clean, stylish design found in our Sarah FloorFlat. Mat features a soft grey and muted black design set against a crisp white backdrop aligned to have a tile-like appearance. The pleasant hues match your welcoming personality and home decor-style while at the same time protecting your precious floors. Our 2’ x 3’ mat is the ideal size in front of your kitchen or bathroom sink, in your entryway, laundry room and more BENEFITS OF FLOOR FLATS Our FloorFlats have been developed by design to lay flat on any hard surface floor (not recommended for carpet). Resting flush with your flooring, our low profile 2mm flats prevent doors from catching on the mat while opening and closing. The no curl edges of the mat lay flat so no need to worry about tripping or falling. DURABLE AND RESISTANT Thin, premium matte vinyl mats protect your floors from spills, scratches, abrasions, and the wear-and-tear of daily use. Spruce up the high traffic spaces in your home without the costly expense of new floors. Our mats are suitable for both indoor and covered outdoor patios. The decorative pattern and dynamic colors provide aesthetic appeal that will continue to please over the years. EASY TO CLEAN Our low maintenance FloorFlats are easy to clean plus stain and fade resistant. These waterproof mats offer trouble-free cleaning in just seconds! No need for harsh chemicals or carpet cleaners, simply wipe with soapy water for a just-like-new finish. Spills, dirt, pet messes – no worries! FloorFlats will quickly become your go-to-solution in many areas of your home. PATRIOTIC AND RESPONSIBLE Our FloorFlats are proudly made in the USA. Your family’s safety is of upmost importance so feel comfortable knowing our materials are are non-toxic and kid/pet friendly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OEQzUe61L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carolina Creekhouse","source_asin":"B08X4ZLTF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X4ZLTF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X4ZLTF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
