window.products.push({"id":576691,"name":"AMTANT Mother of the Bride Wine Tumbler Gifts Box | Funny Personalized Gifts for Bride Mother in Law, Wedding, Engagement, Bridal Shower Bachelorette ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717uWcf6mBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★A Perfect Gift: You will get a stainless steel wine tumbmler,a stainless steel straw and brush,a wine stopper and a stainless steel bracelet with\"today a bride, tomorrow a wife, always your daughter\"printed on it. This novel and delicate wine glass will win WOW praise from all guests. The bachelorette / bridal shower / wedding party decorations for the bride's mom are set. Imagine the look on her face when she opens the gift box and finds this personalized mother of the bride 12 oz tumbler which can be used for any drink. ★Modern Design and Safety -We have passed FDA certification. Insulated bride mom's wine cup crafted from 100% food grade 18/8 stainless steel. No harmful Chemicals and dishwasher safe. The insulated wine glass with a removable BPA-free lid, designed for Sweat-FREE convenience! Besides, they will fell in love with it as ergonomic shape creats a effortless feel in hand. ★Environmental Protection And Insulation： Forget about single-walled or even plastic tumblers. Sure, they can hold a drink, but sooner or later you'll wish that cold drink hadn’t gone warm, or left condensation rings all over your surface. Our wine tumbler with their double walls, thermo-regulate your drinks so you can enjoy them down to the last refreshing drop in the summer. This double wall wine cup will keeps your berverage cold up to 9 hours and hot up to 3 hours. ★Wildly Use： Whether its by the pool, on the boat, lake or beach, lake house, beach house, poolside, camping, cruising, for the Wedding party or Engagement party, This unbreakable insulated travel tumbler makes the perfect companion for alcoholic AND non-alcoholic drinks; wine, champagne, cocktails, mocktails, mimosas, juice, coffee, iced coffee, water, tea and more. ★100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE- Your satisfaction is our #1 priority. We want to continue bringing the best service and affordable high-quality product to our customers each. Everyone will be loved this delicate crafted wine glass at first sight. Celebrating one of the most important events in your life should be easy and affordable and we look forward to being apart of it. If you are not positively thrilled with our cup, just let us know and we will issue a prompt replacement or full refund","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717uWcf6mBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMTANT","source_asin":"B08ZXMPD7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZXMPD7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZXMPD7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
