window.products.push({"id":576775,"name":"Godagoda Set of 3 Non-stick Cake Pan Leakproof Round/Square/Heart Springform Pan Set Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i7MEGYvXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SpecificationMaterial: metalColor: blackWeight: 760gSize: Square: 240*65mmRound：220*65mmHeart：200*65mmCertification: FDAPackage list: 1set baking pan (includes 3 pieces of cake pan)Description1. NON-STICK PAN-- the non-sticky surfaces of the pans make it easier to take the cake out without damaging its structure or texture.2. GOOD QUALITY-- this pan set is made from durable metal that can bake over and over again with the same great results. The sturdy construction makes cakes and pies come out perfectly round every time, coated in long-lasting nonstick for excellent food release and easy cleanup.3. THREE SIZE AND SHAPE-- this set contains 3 pieces of non-stick and leakproof pans, different sizes and shapes, designed for making cheesecakes and more. The pans have sides that spring free from the base, releasing desserts without breakage. 4. LEAKPROOF-- cake pan set are designed with leak-proof tight seal, preventing messy spills.5. EASY TO USE-- can be separated, so it is convenient for you to clean the cake mold. Hand wash with mild detergent. (warm tips: you should cool the pan after using and then clean it, please do not clean it with cold water immediately after using.)6. USE AND CARE: in order to maintain the life time of the cake pan, there are some suggestion for you below: * Clean the pan before using.* Please put a little grease (lard oil, ghee, oils, etc.) on the surface.* Dry the pan with low temperature around 5 minutes and cool to normal temperature * Wash in warm soapy water with soft cloth and wipe it to dry.* Please don't use sharp utensil to scratch the surface.Notes:1. Please allowed 1-3mm differences due to manual measurement, thanks.2. Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i7MEGYvXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Souarts","source_asin":"B07QDMVWMX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QDMVWMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QDMVWMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
