window.products.push({"id":576816,"name":"White Gauze Table Runner Cotton Wedding Decorations Rustic Cheesecloth Table Runner Cheese Cloth Fabric Bulk for White Party décor, Bohemian Table Run","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G0hMpLfoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<P>100% Cotton Gauze Table Runner</P> 100% Cotton cheesecloth table runner is made of 100% cotton cheese cloth fabric which is a natural and breathable material that is both durable and easy to care for. Our natural gauze table runners are dyed with safe dyes by hand in a small workshop in Ukraine, ensuring that the colors are modern and unique. Unlike mass-market runners made of polyester fabric, gauze table cloth used in this table runner is a natural and sustainable material that is biodegradable and eco-friendly Extra long gauze table runner has 141 inch long and 33 in wide. Rustic table runner has an ultimate size which is perfectly matches to any types of tables (round or rectangular). It is a perfect length for a 6 ft table if you want an effect of fluffy and floating, and also a perfect length for a 9 ft long table if you want an effect of draping to the floor. This is an extra long table runner which fits to the most types of all foldable banquette, wedding or party tables. All ends are finished. This 100% cotton white cheesecloth table cloth runner has no frill ends. All ends are finished providing a neat and clean appearance. Your Magic Moment beige cheesecloth table runner is produced from natural cotton gauze fabric. Its areal density is 36 grams per square mtr. No frills or tassels, making it a versatile choice for any table decoration. The snow white color of the cheese cloth gauze table runner adds a boho, charming and modern touch to your occasion. Occasions to apply: for white wedding reception, wedding decorations for ceremony outside or main table the dessert table or candy bar setup. Or you can create a beautiful photo backdrop in white color combinations. It can also be used to decorate the wedding arch or as a backdrop for any event. For boho baby shower enthusiasts it can be used as a backdrop or as a table decoration piece for centerpieces decoration for tables, adding a touch of boho vintage, sheer charm to any event. Our white table runner is a versatile piece that can be used for various occasions such as bridal baby shower decorations, baby shower decoration, birthday party decor, wedding reception. YMM white cheese cloth table runner can be draped over tables or chairs as a decorative piece, adding a touch of elegance to any event. With our decorative gauze muslin fabric you can create bohemian center pieces decoration for table setup, wedding ceremony backdrop for photo Get 7 white cheesecloth gauze napkins out of 1 gauze table runner. You can turn 1 table runner to 7 decorative gauze cheesecloth napkins. Start by cutting the cheese cloths runner into seven equal pieces, each measuring approximately 20 inches in length and 10 inches in width. Use a measuring tape and a pair of sharp scissors to ensure that each piece is cut accurately. To avoid frill ends wet your finger and roll each side of the napkin between your fingers to fix the end. Let it to dry off. Care instruction: Hand wash only. Wash under 86F. No dry cleaning, shedding is possible. Sun fading is possible. Keep away from fire. Dry vertically to make it flat. Wrap gauze runner as a ball to make it wrinkled. Visit our page for more color variation. The color of our rustic table runner may appear slightly different in real life compared to what is shown on the pictures due to a few reasons. 1.The runner for table is a handmade product and may have slight variations in color due to the nature of the dying process. 2 The color may appear different depending on the lighting in the room where the cheesecloth gauze runner is being used. 3 the monitor settings can vary from device to device depending on the screen setup. Visit Your Magic Moment store! We are excited to offer you a wide selection of beautiful and unique event decorations, including table runners, spandex table skirts, and more. Our products are made with high-quality materials and are designed to add a touch of elegance and charm to any occasion. Whether you are hosting a birthday party, bridal, baby shower, wedding ceremony or any other special event, we have the perfect table decorations to make your event truly magical!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G0hMpLfoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Your Magic Moment","source_asin":"B0BWVDSRBP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWVDSRBP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWVDSRBP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
