window.products.push({"id":576869,"name":"Power Lift Recliner,EVER ADVANCED Lift Chairs Recliners for Elderly, Electric Recliners Chair with Heat Vibration Massage, Remote Control,USB Port, 2 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YjAr2vW1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【Soft Faux Leather Upholstery】This electric recline chair is filled with thick and high resilience memory sponge covered by faux leather with comfortable touch feeling. Soft faux leather surface is easy to clean by wet cloth with superior comfort and aesthetics.Overstuffed pillow designed on back, seat and armrest for support, the lift recliners provide a very comfortable sitting feel and enhances safety. ❤【Upgrade Multiple Massage Function】With 8 points massage (back, lumbar, thigh, leg) with 5 adjustable modes and 2 intensity options, the massging recliner offers you a full body massage relaxing at your own home. Also the power lift chair has heating function on lumbar part while massaging, which will be good for waist pressure relief and blood circulation, taking away the stress and tiredness. There is timer function in 15/30/60 minutes which is convenient for you to set massaging time. ❤【Powerful Lift Recliner】With single motor and ergonomic design, the lifting recliner is easy to lay back, lift or tilt to stand. It smoothly provides ultimate lounging experience for reading, watching TV and sleeping.Also the massage recliner quietly pushes the entire chair up to help the senior stand up easily without adding stress to back or knees, letting you stop the lift at any positions you prefer and great ideal for elderly and the person who are recovering from illness. ❤【Classic Design,Durable】The faux leather diamond-shaped pattern design on the lift chair backrest is very retro and fashionable, and the calm brown appearance is suitable for most home decoration style. With USB outlet, 2 cup holders, 2 large side pockets,the single recliner sofa is a perfect place for your daily rest, nap, watching TV, home theater,which also holds a capacity of 330 lbs with durable frame and material. ❤【Warranty & Customer Service】The recline chair is shipped by 2 Separate Boxes on same day, but the carrier may deliver them to you about 3-5 days apart . No tool needed to assemble and 1-year warranty guarantee.Feel free to contact us for any issue and we provide helpful, prompt and friendly customer service at your disposal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YjAr2vW1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EVER ADVANCED","source_asin":"B0B3MMZNJF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3MMZNJF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3MMZNJF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
