window.products.push({"id":576910,"name":"Swedish Dishcloth/Sponge Cloth Eco-Friendly Reusable Holiday Christmas Tree Design (Snowflake RED + Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pEnjIFfZL._AC_.jpg","description":"THE SWEDISH ECO-FRIENDLY DISHCLOTH: All Swedish Dishcloths sold by Trendy Tripper are made in Europe with natural fibers 70% cellulose wood pulp and 30% recycled cotton fibers. The sponge cloth fabric was invented in 1949 by a Swedish engineer and since then the Swedish dishcloth has been a household staple in most Scandinavian homes. Just lately they have been available in the US. Each Swedish dishcloth will replace 15-17 rolls of paper towel, saving cost and saving our planet. The sponge cloth acts much like a sponge in that it absorbs 15 times its weight in water and is very useful in wiping nearly all household surfaces. The wet sponge cloth is soft like a chamois and is great for wiping up spills or wiping down surfaces in the kitchen and bathroom. Perfect for cleaning refrigerators and refrigerator shelves, stovetops and countertops, even granite. It is also great for washing pans with non-stick surfaces. Many customers even use them for wiping baby’s hands, face and high chairs. Another unique feature is that the Swedish dishcloth dries very quickly which discourages bacteria from growing! This is key to having a clean kitchen. Allow it to dry after use and it should feel clean and not smell like the usual sponges do. The dishcloth is machine washable or you can wash it on the top shelf in the dishwasher. Or pop in the microwave (when damp) for 1 minute. The sponge cloth may be washed a couple hundred times. You can either dry them briefly in the clothes dryer or allow it to air dry. Hang on a dishcloth rail inside the sink where it can dry quickly. When you find that your cloth has reached its life expectancy, toss into your compost heap because it is biodegradable! The possibilities are endless. Customers use these to wipe the boat, do spring cleaning, at the cottage, in your car, for outdoor furniture, in the baby’s room. You will find many different ways for cleaning up with the Swedish dishcloth aka Swedish sponge cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pEnjIFfZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trendy Tripper","source_asin":"B00FCK7VSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FCK7VSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FCK7VSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":576911,"name":"8 Inch Soft Sleeper 5.5 King Mattress Bed With 4 Inches of Visco Elastic Memory Foam Assembly Required USA Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K4OGBqTSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft Sleeper 5.5 has found a way to give you the same great sleep surface as a $5,000 visco-elastic foam mattress for a price starting at 94% less the cost of a traditional visco foam mattress that sell at some retailers for over $5,000! There is a revolution going on in bedrooms across the country. The revolution is not between the sheets...it's under them! Visco-Elastic memory foam uses a technology first developed by NASA to make the most comfort sleep surface ever. We have taken that technology and developed a luxurious Soft Sleeper 5.5 next generation material. You may have seen the visco-foam mattress story on TV but the secret is that you can save money by shopping online instead of paying over $5,000 for their mattress. The Soft Sleeper 5.5 eight inch mattress is a component mattress made from 4 inches of heat sensitive visco elastic memory foam and one 4 inch supportive base component for spinal alignment and support. One base is a firm supportive layer and the sencond layer is made of temperature sensative visco elastic memory foam for comfort. This luxurious Soft Sleeper 5.5 material reacts to your body temperature, so the surface stays cool in the summer and warm in the winter. Over 9 out of 10 of our customers report that the contoured surface cradles their body and helps eliminate those pressure points created by traditional mattress surfaces. Another 89% of our customers even reported less back and neck pain. You will enjoy a rejuvenating sleep with our luxurious Soft Sleeper 5.5 integral component mattresses sleep system from Soft Sleeper memory foam. The Soft Sleeper Memory Foam integral component formula means that our component mattresses are scientifically engineered to exacting standards, incorporating the two most important factors when it comes to making sure you get the best sleep possible. Shipped in 1 or 2 large boxes, some assembly required. For laminated mattresses please visit our All Sleep Store for other Soft Sleeper products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K4OGBqTSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soft Sleeper Visco Elastic Memory Foam","source_asin":"B000Q46B4O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000Q46B4O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000Q46B4O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
