window.products.push({"id":576930,"name":"Silicone Freezing Tray with Lid, Large Ice Cube Tray Non-stick Soup Freezer Container with 4 Compartments for Storing and Freezing Soups, Broths, Sauc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-QjylMF5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multipurpose】The freezer tray can perfectly make the quantitative freezing of bone soup, broth, sauce and other liquids easier, and is often used for portion control of diets. 【Accurate Portion Control】 The 4 compartments are equipped with built-in scales: 125ml (4oz) and 250ml (8oz), and it is very useful for preparing, cooking and freezing meals. Even if it is used for a long time, it will not produce any odor. These silicone freezer containers can be stacked and stored, effectively saving space in the kitchen. 【Food-grade Silicone】 Tutu tiger ice cube trays, including the lid, are all made of food-grade silicone, BPA and PVC free, and can be reused indefinitely, which is better for eliminating plastic and protecting the earth. 【Air Tight Design】The freezing tray lid is made of silicone, which has perfect airtightness. The lid can closely fit the ice freezer container, so the container can keep food fresh and prevent odor leakage. Even if you use the same tray to freeze food containing different ingredients, there will be no mixture of odor. Each separate compartment can effectively prevent the smell or liquid from entering the other compartments. The lid can be heated at the same time as the tray. 【Multifunctional】 Used for freezing and baking, dishwasher safe. The soup freezer tray is naturally non-stick, and it's time-saving and labor-saving to clean it. The tray is safe to use in refrigerators and ovens at -20°C to 220°C. 【Unique design】The inside of the silicone tray is reinforced with a stainless-steel frame, the tray filled with soup will not collapse, and the soup will not overflow when moved. The separate compartments make it easier to remove the ice cubes. Just easily twist or push from the bottom of the silicone ice cube tray to remove ice cubes or soup cubes. 【Sturdy & Durable】The ice cube tray with lid is stable and durable, so no matter how long you store it in the refrigerator, it will not be damaged or cracked due to low temperature. 【Note】Do not seal completely during heating, There is a stainless-steel frame inside the silicone freezing tray, please do not use it in a microwave oven.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-QjylMF5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tutu tiger","source_asin":"B09NZHYWBX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-576930","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NZHYWBX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NZHYWBX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
